lib/patch/parser.ts adapts the apply-patch format and matching approach from
https://github.com/openai/codex, local revision ca6fb194b6, specifically
codex-rs/apply-patch/src/parser.rs, file_update.rs, and seek_sequence.rs.
Licensed under Apache-2.0; see codex-Apache-2.0.txt in this directory.

Generalist modifications: TypeScript implementation, bounded strict parsing,
ambiguity rejection within each Codex-style matching tier, fallback notices,
and preservation of unchanged source bytes and existing EOF newline policy.
The filesystem engine and Pi integration are new Generalist code.

No Ratatui code is used in this adaptation.
